data: {"id": "fa2f4d65ca164e66-final", "run_id": "fa2f4d65ca164e66", "seq": 2050, "ts_ms": 1789088029913, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` | NotReady | 应用依赖资源不可用导致服务返回 HTTP 503，触发 Readiness Probe 持续失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` 状态 `Running`，Phase `Running`，但 `Ready=False` (`ContainersNotReady`) | 描述异常实体的当前生命周期状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning  Unhealthy       18m  kubelet  Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.16:8080/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.16:8080: connect: connection refused` | 确认 Readiness Probe 失败的网络层原因：连接被拒绝 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning  Unhealthy       3m39s (x312 over 18m)  kubelet  Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` | 确认 Probe 失败的应用层表现：收到 503 响应 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | 日志模式 `dependency unavailable` (http_status: 503)，窗口内观测 8 次 (trace_ids: `1aa79a59...` 等) | 确认应用自身日志记录了依赖不可用并返回 503 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 内存请求 24Mi / 限制 96Mi；CPU 请求 20m / 限制 200m | 排除资源超卖或 OOM 导致 503 的可能性 |\n| 6 | Tracing | tempo | Span `GET /work`，`aiops.observed_mode: readiness_fail`，HTTP status 503 (trace_id: `84c5e1e0...`) | 将业务路径与 K8s Probe 的失败模式进行关联确认 |\n\n**证据总结：**\nPod 虽然处于 Running 状态且未重启，但因 Readiness Probe 持续失败而被标记为 `NotReady`。网络日志显示探针请求被直接拒绝（连接失败），而应用日志则记录了服务在处理请求（如 `/work`）时因“依赖不可用”返回了 503 状态码。两者共同表明该容器内的应用进程处于不健康状态。配置显示资源分配合理，排除了资源短缺导致的崩溃或停滞。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用依赖的资源（如 DB、缓存等）不可用（未确认具体依赖项） → 应用无法处理业务请求，返回 HTTP 503（Logging: \"dependency unavailable\", Tracing: 503） → K8s Readiness Probe 请求应用接口 (`/ready`) 时，因应用内部逻辑故障同样返回 503 或应用彻底卡死导致连接被拒绝（Event: \"connection refused\" 或 \"statuscode: 503\"） → 触发 K8s 将 Pod 状态置为 NotReady，阻止流量进入（Event: \"ContainersNotReady\", State: \"Ready=False\"）\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**应用内部依赖资源不可用，导致服务健康检查（Readiness Probe）和业务请求均失败。**\n\n证据链闭环如下：\n- **现象确认**：K8s Event 显示 Probe 持续失败，且伴随 `statuscode: 503`（证据 #3）及 `connection refused`（证据 #2）；Pod 状态被正确标记为 `NotReady`（证据 #1）。\n- **因果定位**：应用侧日志（证据 #4）记录了 `dependency unavailable` 并对外返回 503，Tracing（证据 #6）确认了业务路径（`/work`）与探针的失败模式一致。这解释了应用为何不仅拒绝外部请求，也无法通过自身健康检查。\n- **排除干扰**：资源限制（证据 #5）正常，且容器重启次数为 0，排除了因资源耗尽、OOM 或容器启动失败（CrashLoop）导致的直接中断。\n\n虽然应用返回了 503 和明确的“依赖不可用”日志，但“未确认具体是哪个外部依赖”导致了日志中连接被拒绝（Connection refused）的现象，这说明应用可能存在部分服务完全不可达，或在不同时间窗口表现出不一致性。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 10.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 610.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc: 610.8s (Evidence 603.9s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 648.492, "metrics": {"run_id": "fa2f4d65ca164e66", "mttr": {"value": "10.8m", "seconds": 648.4988570213318, "pass": false, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 648498.8570213318, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 605856.3933372498, "tool_calls": 22, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 22, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 30200.455904006958, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 22433.331966400146}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 23118.512392044067, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 610776.27825737, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14581.880807876587, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

